I look at the screen again.
The code is still missing.
I do not usually have problems with the system.
I read the instructions on the website.
It says: "If the code is not received, a new code can be requested."
I press the link at the bottom of the page.
There is a short message: "Please wait."
A moment later, my phone vibrates on the table.
A new message has finally been sent.
I open the message to read my new code.
It is four, nine, two, seven.
I quickly type the numbers into the empty field.
Afterwards, I press the button "Approve".
The page is updated immediately.
A large green banner is shown on the screen.
The text says: "Your profile is now updated."
I smile and close the website down.
It is always nice when those kinds of practical things are sorted.
